# graphify-out/ generated artifacts (see CLAUDE.md's "graphify" section and #761):
# never silently content-merge them. A divergent change on both sides of a merge
# must surface as an explicit conflict and be resolved by `graphify update .`,
# not by a line-level three-way merge that can leave stale file references or
# corrupt JSON in the committed graph.
graphify-out/graph.json -merge linguist-generated
graphify-out/graph.html -merge linguist-generated
graphify-out/GRAPH_REPORT.md -merge linguist-generated
graphify-out/.graphify_labels.json -merge linguist-generated
graphify-out/.graphify_labels.json.sig -merge linguist-generated
